OL,3,ADaniel Thomas faces trial in 2027 over
OL,4,Amigrant site accusations
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe also denies charges of racially
OL,7,Faggravated harassment and using
OL,8,Fthreatening words or behaviour in Dover
OL,9,Fon 1 April, obstructing a person
OL,10,Fengaged in a lawful activity in Dover
OL,11,Fon 6 April, and entering and remaining
OL,12,Fin Dover Docks without having lawful
OL,13,Fbusiness or permission on both days.
